  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Four regional partners: Asian Institute of Technology, WWF, WorldFish Center and CORIN/University of Songkla. In addition, some 40 local    partners that implement local level activities in Cambodia, Lao PDR   and Vietnam. Some capacity building activities takes place in         Thailand. The programme focus on strengthening of aquatic resources   management and associated livelihoods improvements.</narrative>
